// private wireRuntimeEvents(session, runtime): runtime.on("notification", closure)
// Closure behavior (source order):
//   turn/started: ignore a duplicate when the turn already exists as inProgress.
//   item/completed | item/started: stamp item.turnId from params.turnId ??
//     session.activeTurnId; upsert into session.messages by item.id — replace
//     in place, except item/started for a terminal (completed/failed/
//     interrupted) existing item is ignored; push when new.
//   turn/completed: mark turn completed, clear activeTurnId, persistSession.
//   turn/failed | turn/interrupted: mark turn failed/interrupted, clear
//     activeTurnId, persistSession.
//   Finally this.emit("notification", notif) re-emits everything.
